# text = That proves you have a wicked heart ; and you must pray to God to change it : to give you a new and clean one : to take away your heart of stone and give you a heart of flesh Mr . Brocklehurst , I believe I intimated in the letter which I wrote to you three weeks ago , that this little girl has not quite the character and disposition I could wish : should you admit her into Lowood school , I should be glad if the superintendent and teachers were requested to keep a strict eye on her , and , above all , to guard against her worst fault , a tendency to deceit .
