# text = I will speak to Miss Temple and the teachers I should wish her to be brought up in a manner suiting her prospects to be made useful , to be kept humble : as for the vacations , she will , with your permission , spend them always at Lowood Your decisions are perfectly judicious , madam Humility is a Christian grace , and one peculiarly appropriate to the pupils of Lowood ; I , therefore , direct that especial care shall be bestowed on its cultivation amongst them .
