# text = I'm sure last winter ( it was a very severe one , if you recollect , and when it did not snow , it rained and blew ), not a creature but the butcher and postman came to the house , from November till February ; and I really got quite melancholy with sitting night after night alone ; I had Leah in to read to me sometimes ; but I don't think the poor girl liked the task much : she felt it confining .
