# text = Do you feel ill , sir Jane , I've got a blow ; I've got a blow , Jane Oh , lean on me , sir Jane , you offered me your shoulder once before ; let me have it now Yes , sir , yes ; and my arm My little friend I wish I were in a quiet island with only you ; and trouble , and danger , and hideous recollections removed from me Can I help you , sir ? -- I'd give my life to serve you Jane , if aid is wanted , I'll seek it at your hands ; I promise you that Thank you , sir .
