# text = Now , Jane , trip on before us away to the backstairs ; unbolt the side-passage door , and tell the driver of the post-chaise you will see in the yard -- or just outside , for I told him not to drive his rattling wheels over the pavement -- to be ready ; we are coming : and , Jane , if any one is about , come to the foot of the stairs and hem Take care of him and keep him at your house till he is quite well : I shall ride over in a day or two to see how he gets on .
