# text = Richard , how is it with you The fresh air revives me , Fairfax Leave the window open on his side , Carter ; there is no wind -- good - bye , Dick Well what is it I do my best ; and have done it , and will do it Yet would to God there was an end of all this Jane Come where there is some freshness , for a few moments that house is a mere dungeon : don't you feel it so It seems to me a splendid mansion , sir The glamour of inexperience is over your eyes all is real , sweet , and pure Jane , will you have a flower
