# text = I am strangely glad to get back again to you : and wherever you are is my home -- my only home prete e croquer sa petite maman Anglaise Day its fervid fires had wasted Now , he has his back towards me and he is occupied too ; perhaps , if I walk softly , I can slip away unnoticed I shall get by very well Jane , come and look at this fellow Look at his wings he reminds me rather of a West Indian insect ; one does not often see so large and gay a night-rover in England ; there !
