# text = ) mixed with the air I breathed ; and besides , I remembered I had once been her husband -- that recollection was then , and is now , inexpressibly odious to me ; moreover , I knew that while she lived I could never be the husband of another and better wife ; and , though five years my senior ( her family and her father had lied to me even in the particular of her age ), she was likely to live as long as I , being as robust in frame as she was infirm in mind .
