# text = I was physically influenced by the atmosphere and scene , and my ears were filled with the curses the maniac still shrieked out ; wherein she momentarily mingled my name with such a tone of demon-hate , with such language ! -- no professed harlot ever had a fouler vocabulary than she : though two rooms off , I heard every word -- the thin partitions of the West India house opposing but slight obstruction to her wolfish cries .
