# text = His , under such circumstances , is the destiny of the pioneer ; and the first pioneers of the Gospel were the Apostles -- their captain was Jesus , the Redeemer , Himself Well proceed I believe you will accept the post I offer you and hold it for a while : not permanently , though : any more than I could permanently keep the narrow and narrowing -- the tranquil , hidden office of English country incumbent ; for in your nature is an alloy as detrimental to repose as that in mine , though of a different kind Do explain I will ; and you shall hear how poor the proposal is , -- how trivial -- how cramping .
