# text = The best things the world has No , Jane , no : this world is not the scene of fruition ; do not attempt to make it so : nor of rest ; do not turn slothful I mean , on the contrary , to be busy Jane , I excuse you for the present : two months' grace I allow you for the full enjoyment of your new position , and for pleasing yourself with this late-found charm of relationship ; but THEN , I hope you will begin to look beyond Moor House and Morton , and sisterly society , and the selfish calm and sensual comfort of civilised affluence .
